# Keep docker build contexts small. Files listed here aren't even sent to
# the docker daemon — speeds up builds and avoids accidentally baking secrets
# or local state into images.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/storage/uploads/*
**/storage/outputs/*
**/storage/work/*
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/README.md
